* NMP standalone topology for VMD Solvate/psfgen
* Residue generated with CGenFF program 4.0 for CGenFF topology/parameters 5.0
*
36 1

! Atom types required by the NMP residue.
! These MASS definitions make this topology self-contained for psfgen.
MASS  -1  HGA2       1.00800 H  ! aliphatic proton, CH2
MASS  -1  HGA3       1.00800 H  ! aliphatic proton, CH3
MASS  -1  CG2R53    12.01100 C  ! 5-membered ring carbonyl carbon
MASS  -1  CG331     12.01100 C  ! aliphatic methyl carbon
MASS  -1  CG3C52    12.01100 C  ! 5-membered ring aliphatic CH2
MASS  -1  NG2R53    14.00700 N  ! amide N in 5-membered non-sp2 ring
MASS  -1  OG2D1     15.99940 O  ! carbonyl oxygen

DEFA FIRS NONE LAST NONE
AUTO ANGLES DIHE

RESI NMP            0.000 ! param penalty=1.500; charge penalty=0.933
GROUP
ATOM C1     CG331  -0.161
ATOM H1     HGA3    0.090
ATOM H2     HGA3    0.090
ATOM H3     HGA3    0.090
ATOM N2     NG2R53 -0.098
ATOM C3     CG3C52 -0.077
ATOM H4     HGA2    0.090
ATOM H5     HGA2    0.090
ATOM C4     CG3C52 -0.233
ATOM H6     HGA2    0.090
ATOM H7     HGA2    0.090
ATOM C5     CG3C52 -0.027
ATOM H8     HGA2    0.090
ATOM H9     HGA2    0.090
ATOM C6     CG2R53  0.286
ATOM O7     OG2D1  -0.500

BOND C1 H1  C1 H2  C1 H3  C1 N2
BOND N2 C3  N2 C6
BOND C3 H4  C3 H5  C3 C4
BOND C4 H6  C4 H7  C4 C5
BOND C5 H8  C5 H9  C5 C6
DOUBLE C6 O7
IMPR C6 C5 N2 O7

PATCHING FIRS NONE LAST NONE
END
